[CENTER]
[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF4444]◆[/COLOR] [COLOR=#FFFFFF]ABOUT THE PLUGIN[/COLOR] [COLOR=#FF4444]◆[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[/CENTER]

[COLOR=#CCCCCC]
[B]NewBedwars[/B] is a modern, fully configurable Bedwars plugin built from the ground up for [COLOR=#50fa7b][B]Paper 1.17 – 26.x[/B][/COLOR]. You get the classic Bedwars experience (teams, beds, generators, shops) plus a proper in-game setup system, YAML-driven GUIs, multi-arena support and deep gamerule control. No extra plugins needed.
[/COLOR]

[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Multiple arenas at once, each in its own world, with automatic map reset after every game[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]In-game arena setup, no file editing required[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Configurable shops, team upgrades, traps, generators and game phases[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Parties, spectator mode, rejoin, arena-isolated chat, boss bars and scoreboards[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Player stats, leaderboards and profile GUI[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Six languages: English, Polish, German, Spanish, French and Russian[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Optional PlaceholderAPI and WorldEdit / FastAsyncWorldEdit support[/COLOR]
[*][COLOR=#50fa7b]✔[/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Developer API for addons[/COLOR]
[/LIST]

[CENTER]
[COLOR=#ffd93d][B]⚠ This is a beta release.[/B][/COLOR] [COLOR=#CCCCCC]Core gameplay is stable and feature-complete. Please report any issues on GitHub.[/COLOR]
[/CENTER]

[CENTER]
[SIZE=1][COLOR=#333333]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/COLOR][/SIZE]
[/CENTER]
[CENTER]
